WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.384
Dr. Dolittle did not know what to do.

2
00:00:04.385 --> 00:00:07.949
"I must get back to Puddleby," he kept saying.

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.466
"We don’t have a boat," Jip pointed out.

4
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:16.360
Dr. Dolittle had forgotten about that.

5
00:00:16.361 --> 00:00:18.810
Polynesia flew to the dungeon.

6
00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:23.796
"Get Dr. Dolittle! Hurry!" Polynesia whispered to Gub-Gub.

7
00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:29.761
When the doctor came, Polynesia told him about the prince.

8
00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:32.966
Dr. Dolittle looked in his medicine bag.

9
00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:36.602
"Hmmm, well, let’s see . . ."

10
00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:40.351
"Ask him to let you out," the parrot continued.

11
00:00:40.352 --> 00:00:43.005
"We could ask the prince for a boat!"

12
00:00:43.006 --> 00:00:44.943
Jip barked excitedly.

13
00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:50.693
"Good idea, Jip!" smiled Dr. Dolittle.

14
00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:52.912
The prince waited until dark.

15
00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:57.318
Then he went to the dungeon just as the fairy godmother had said.

16
00:00:57.319 --> 00:01:01.859
"Dolittle! Dr. Dolittle!" he called softly.

17
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:06.212
"My fairy godmother said you have a magic bottle.

18
00:01:06.213 --> 00:01:09.706
May I have it?"

19
00:01:09.707 --> 00:01:12.442
Dr. Dolittle scratched his head.

20
00:01:12.443 --> 00:01:15.220
"Well, yes, of course you may.

21
00:01:15.221 --> 00:01:18.475
But first you must let me out of this dungeon."

22
00:01:18.476 --> 00:01:21.477
Jip reminded the doctor about the boat.

23
00:01:21.478 --> 00:01:27.682
"Oh, and also, you must find me a boat . . . ," Dr. Dolittle continued.

24
00:01:27.683 --> 00:01:31.404
Gub-Gub wanted to ask for one more thing.

25
00:01:31.405 --> 00:01:37.705
". . . with lots of food in it," the doctor added.

26
00:01:37.706 --> 00:01:40.845
The prince quietly unlocked the dungeon.

27
00:01:40.846 --> 00:01:42.006
"Get me a boat.

28
00:01:42.007 --> 00:01:45.414
I will meet you on the beach," the doctor said.

29
00:01:45.415 --> 00:01:48.868
"What will you give him, Doctor?" asked Jip.

30
00:01:48.869 --> 00:01:51.644
The doctor took out a black bottle.

31
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:56.883
"What is it for?" asked Dab-Dab.

32
00:01:56.884 --> 00:02:01.317
"This medicine makes the hair grow quickly," explained the doctor.

33
00:02:01.318 --> 00:02:04.886
"That’s what the prince wants," said Dab-Dab.

34
00:02:04.887 --> 00:02:10.578
"But it’s not . . . human hair," the doctor looked away.

35
00:02:10.579 --> 00:02:13.942
"What kind of hair is it?" asked Dab-Dab.

36
00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:18.737
"It’s dog hair."

37
00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:22.438
The prince was waiting for Dr. Dolittle beside a boat.

38
00:02:22.439 --> 00:02:26.524
"Now give me my magic bottle!" he said excitedly.

39
00:02:26.525 --> 00:02:32.058
The prince jumped up and down like a boy.

40
00:02:32.059 --> 00:02:35.858
Dr. Dolittle rubbed the lotion on the prince’s head.

41
00:02:35.859 --> 00:02:39.290
"Is it growing?" the prince asked excitedly.

42
00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:42.277
Dr. Dolittle rubbed more and more.

43
00:02:42.278 --> 00:02:46.332
Then he poured the whole bottle onto the prince’s head.

44
00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:52.681
Just like grass, one, then two, then ten hairs started popping up.

45
00:02:52.682 --> 00:02:57.680
The prince was growing hair.

46
00:02:57.681 --> 00:02:58.948
"I have hair!

47
00:02:58.949 --> 00:03:02.464
I have hair!" the prince shouted joyfully.

48
00:03:02.465 --> 00:03:05.184
He was beginning to look like Jip!

49
00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:08.239
But he didn’t have a mirror to see himself.

50
00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:12.511
The prince ran off into the jungle, singing and dancing.

51
00:03:12.512 --> 00:03:18.587
"Jip! You and the prince could be brothers!" teased Chee-Chee.

52
00:03:18.588 --> 00:03:21.184
"Poor prince," Too-Too said.

53
00:03:21.185 --> 00:03:25.010
"Don’t worry. In two weeks, it will all fall out again.

54
00:03:25.011 --> 00:03:30.051
I will send him the proper medicine when I get home," Dr. Dolittle replied.

55
00:03:30.052 --> 00:03:36.339
"Hurry and go before the prince comes back!" Polynesia said.

56
00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:40.909
Everyone got in the boat except Polynesia and Chee-Chee.

57
00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.739
"Aren’t you coming?" asked Jip.

58
00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:48.370
"Africa is our home," Polynesia said sadly.

59
00:03:48.371 --> 00:03:52.345
"We want to stay here," Chee-Chee added.

60
00:03:52.346 --> 00:03:54.289
Dr. Dolittle nodded.

61
00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:59.702
"I understand. I will miss you both very much."

62
00:03:59.703 --> 00:04:04.572
The parrot and monkey hugged Dr. Dolittle.

63
00:04:04.573 --> 00:04:07.350
They waved good-bye to their friends.

64
00:04:07.351 --> 00:04:12.233
"Good-bye, Dr. Dolittle!" cried Polynesia and Chee-Chee.

65
00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:17.993
And the boat left Africa.

